    "# 1. Business Understanding & Problem definition"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "5e1f1ede-863a-439a-9025-d0e17b0922fa",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Problem definition:\n",
    "We are a team of Media data analytics. We want to understand:\n",
    "1. How User behave on instagram\n",
    "2. What type of content performs well on instagram,\n",
    "3. How engagement varies accross different segment of audience,\n",
    "4. What people express in comments\n",
    "\n",
    "# Problem statement by AI\n",
    "1. Content Type Performance Analysis\n",
    "2. Popular Content Topics Analysis\n",
    "3. Best Day and Time for Posting\n",
    "4. Audience Demographics and Geographic Analysis\n",
    "5. Influencer and High-Reach Creator Identification\n",
    "6. Hashtag Performance and Optimization\n",
    "7. Audience Sentiment Analysis\n",
    "8. Viral Content Identification and Analysis\n",
    "9. Audience Loyalty and Community Engagement Analysis\n",
    "10. Instagram Reach Prediction Using Machine Learning"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "id": "02137761-5196-4de1-90cd-a069630a7653",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Business Understanding\n",
    "Content Sharing: Instagram allows users to share photos, videos, Reels, and Stories.\n",
    "User Interaction: Users interact with content through likes, comments, shares, saves, and direct messages.\n",
    "Recommendation Algorithm: Instagram uses AI algorithms to recommend content based on users' interests and activities.\n",
    "Business Promotion: Businesses and creators use Instagram to promote products, build brands, and reach potential customers.\n",
    "Revenue Generation: Instagram primarily earns revenue through advertisements displayed in Feeds, Stories, and Reels."
   ]
  },
